  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $A\\subseteq \\{1,\\ldots N\\}$ be a set such that there exists at most one $n$ with more than one solution to $n=a+b$ (with $a\\leq b\\in A$). Estimate the maximal possible size of $\\lvert A\\rvert$ - in particular, is it true that $ \\lvert A\\rvert \\leq (1+o(1))\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}N^{1/2}? $ ",
